<title>CANADA: Saskatchewan Agriculture details seeding progress.</title>
<headline>Saskatchewan Agriculture details seeding progress.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saskatchewan Agriculture on Tuesday detailed the level of seeding progress to June 1.</p>
<p>	   S.WHEAT  DURUM  OATS  BARLEY  FLAX  CANOLA  ALL CROPS</p>
<p>June 1/97 96 pct  98 pct 77 pct 85 pct 82 pct 89 pct  92 pct 92/96 Avg 89 pct  94 pct 69 pct 79 pct 73 pct 77 pct  85 pct</p>
<p>	   MUSTARD  SNFLWR LNTLS PEAS CANARY SEED</p>
<p>June 1/97 94 pct  87 pct 99 pct 96 pct 95 pct</p>
<p>92/96 Avg 87 pct  70 pct 94 pct 90 pct 86 pct</p>
<p>N.B.: all crops includes specialty crops.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
